  "title": {
   "en": "Kon'ya Coin Randorii de Aimashou"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja-ro": "今夜コインランドリーで逢いましょう"
   },
   {
    "en": "See you at the Laundromat tonight"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Narita, a family restaurant employee in his late twenties who is always busy with work, is feeling down about the results of his job interview,\nwhile he is having dinner, he is absentmindedly watching a video recommended to him on a video site.\n\nThe video shows Sasa Yoruzaki, an artist with an overwhelming sense of fashion and singing ability, despite her cool and slightly cheeky responses.\n\nLater, when he goes to an old laundromat to deal with some laundry problems, he suddenly notices a woman and feels something is off about her. The woman seems familiar, but it is Sasa himself, the one he had just seen in the video."
  },
